repository-code: "https://github.com/chpollin/klawiter-rescue"
url: "https://chpollin.github.io/klawiter-rescue/"
abstract: >-
  Digital edition of the Stefan Zweig bibliography compiled by
  Dr. Randolph J. Klawiter (University of Notre Dame). Extracted from
  a decommissioned MediaWiki database, structured as JSON-LD using
  Schema.org, Dublin Core, and a domain-specific vocabulary. Includes
  a static web frontend with faceted search, citation export, and
  interactive visualizations.
keywords:
  - Stefan Zweig
  - bibliography
  - digital humanities
  - JSON-LD
  - linked data
  - data rescue
